# W31d, d (k10): in stag0201 with b and c; answers a's notice at once: its GO is stamped with the relay's test hook (World:
# TestGoHook defeat: d falls at the GO's tick, before it): the GO does nothing on every engine of the stage group,
# "Couldn't go along: you were defeated."; c's GO takes it along later.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@140
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log d in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@900
log d sees the notice
idle until frames>=40
goalong until go=waiting or go=stamped or go=going
log d asked to go along
idle until dead,go=none fail frames>=3600,stage=dng204b1
log d fell at its GO, the GO did nothing
idle until stage=dng204b1 fail epoch>=@1200
log d taken along into dng204b1
idle until present=4,sealed>=300,alive fail epoch>=@1200
log d alive in B1
